+## Classic raid augments — November 12 feature candidate
+
+Use the `classic-raid-augments` context. The sixteen single-quality LORE trophies (963200–963215) fit one chest-only type-22 socket at level 50. Their per-ID LORE projection is an exception to global suppression, including socketed custody. Independent 25/15/50% corpse rolls cover dragons, secondary bosses and planar finals. Managed drops require Raid objective credit. The three capstones share a persisted 90-second timer. Power Source, pet and displaced Hunt bonuses are excluded. Master Yael 39138 has no confirmed public spawn route; the managed Hole finale is a different NPC.
+
+Feature checkout E:/EQ_Local_Dev/_worktrees/classic-raid-augments. Catalog, source mapping, deterministic tests and SQL: config/classic-raid-augments.json, tools/classic_raid_augments.py, tools/tests/test_raid_augment*. Full local test binaries and effective cache were checked. Isolated development only; see docs/items/classic-raid-augments/README.md for the latest balance and QA boundaries. Install matching world/zone/shared_memory, apply guarded content and rebuild the cache on the intended test stack. Standard RoF2 LORE and type-22 fields use the existing signed client. No production rollout, public wiki publication or owner acceptance is recorded.
 
